        <mxCell id="footnote" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;fontColor=#475569;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;" value="&lt;b&gt;Default path:&lt;/b&gt; data travels &lt;b&gt;via Home&lt;/b&gt; (two hops).  &lt;b&gt;DCT / DMT&lt;/b&gt; let the provider forward read data directly to the Requester; &lt;b&gt;DWT&lt;/b&gt; lets the Requester send write data directly to the Subordinate.  Home is still notified via a response so it can retire the transaction." vertex="1">
